INSKY, LLP NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF ACTIVISION BLIZZARD, INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF OCTOBER 4, 2021 - ATVI', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 26, 2021) - THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IS BEING ISSUED BY LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP:TO: ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SECURITIES OF ACTIVISION BLIZZARD, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: ATVI)\xa0("ACTIVISION BLIZZARD") BETWEEN AUGUST 4, 2016 AND JULY 27, 2021. YOU ARE HEREBY NOTIFIED THAT A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE CENTRAL DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA. TO GET MORE INFORMATION GO...'}